252
00:16:00,140 --> 00:16:01,660
There's too many of them!

253
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:03,897
Things aren't looking good for us!

254
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:05,560
Any news from Onigashima?

255
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,257
Can't get a hold of them!

256
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:10,575
I bet they're preoccupied
with the big party right now!

257
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:14,300
So my efforts were all
for naught in the end!

258
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:16,820
Damn you, Kin'emon!

259
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:19,650
Bravo!

260
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:21,020
As expected,

261
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:25,454
you have risen to the occasion and
proven to be quite the capable leader!

262
00:16:38,780 --> 00:16:40,940
Yes, Worf, of course.

263
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:43,120
Not Tokage Port.

264
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:55,220
You guys can be honest with us, Kin'emon.

265
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:56,750
No offense,

266
00:16:56,833 --> 00:16:58,197
but we've known you
long enough to know that

267
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:00,986
a plan like this is not
within your skill set.

268
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:05,380
Just admit you made a mistake
and we won't be angry. Stop it.

269
00:17:06,020 --> 00:17:08,017
You thought the message was Tokage.

270
00:17:08,100 --> 00:17:09,218
You cannot fool me.

271
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,280
I said stop it.

272
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,717
At least the mistake settled in our favor.

273
00:17:12,800 --> 00:17:14,094
What a happy accident.

274
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:20,688
To be honest, I fear that I
might perish in the battle ahead.

275
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:24,157
i did just use up a whole lifetime's worth

276
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:28,697
of luck after all i can scarcely disagree

277
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:31,817
with that master get him on we'll follow

278
00:17:31,900 --> 00:17:35,517
you anywhere so if you
are lucky then we are

279
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,797
lucky to have you at
our side in this battle

280
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:44,437
and even if you do die
out there at the very

281
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:47,057
least we will all die beside We serve Lord

282
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:49,257
Odin together and will
avenge him together.

283
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:54,281
We may have come from different worlds, but
we are comrades in arms now, to the end.

284
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:05,807
Such pleasantries from scoundrels
like you, hardly comforting.

285
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:10,818
Hold up your sword with pride, keen!

286
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:13,628
We shall claim victory
in the opening fight!

287
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:21,080
Win or lose, I'm prepared.

288
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:24,120
We will avenge Lord Odin!

289
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:25,380
The time is now!

290
00:18:27,220 --> 00:18:28,260
Master Kin'emon!

291
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:31,866
You have our full support,
no matter the cost!

292
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,080
Never mind, Kin'emon.

293
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:41,197
I must make haste to Onigashima.

294
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:44,809
The role assigned to be by Lord
Orochi is still unfulfilled.

295
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:48,320
There's one thing I have left to do.

296
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:57,710
Anjuro!

297
00:18:58,540 --> 00:19:00,900
You won't take Lord Momonosuke!

298
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:07,180
How about you?

299
00:19:07,300 --> 00:19:09,040
I am on my way! Stop it!

300
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:11,237
You'll drown if you jump into the sea!

301
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:17,060
You would trample our dreams and
get us with a smile, you bastard!

302
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:21,500
I admit, I do find
pleasure in this moment.

303
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:25,658
Sabotage, duplicity, betrayal
with a surprise ending.

304
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:28,348
What a complex role I
had the honor to play.

305
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:33,700
And speaking of roles, thank you
all so much for playing the fool.

306
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,650
Conchino!

307
00:19:44,100 --> 00:19:48,460
What better way to end the play than
to stain the stage with Kozuki blood?

308
00:19:56,340 --> 00:19:57,380
Kawamatsu, help!

309
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:58,800
Lord Momonosuke!

310
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:01,560
Don't you worry, Momonosuke.

311
00:20:01,760 --> 00:20:03,957
I'll let your sister
follow you into death.

312
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,497
You hear that, Kawamatsu?

313
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:07,797
I will find Hiyori and slay her, too!

314
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:11,120
You fools confirm she's alive after all.

315
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:15,620
Damn you, Kanjuro!

316
00:20:16,140 --> 00:20:18,846
That crane you painted
is flying immaculately!

317
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:21,177
What of the monstrosities you made us?

318
00:20:21,260 --> 00:20:22,960
They washed away with water!

319
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:24,927
I thought you lacked talent!

320
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,920
It's too high!

321
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:29,997
Someone please get me
down from here, please!

322
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:32,760
I don't wanna die! Kanjuro? Momo?

323
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:35,320
Wait, where are you going?

324
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:37,894
This is the last you'll ever see of me!

325
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:44,320
This is only a fraction
of Commander Taito's army.

326
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:47,460
You'll be dead before
you ever reach the shore.

327
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,920
Someone help me!

328
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:57,880
Let him go!

329
00:20:58,340 --> 00:20:59,680
Lord Momonosuke, no!

330
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:02,844
You'll pay for betraying
the Akazaya 9, Kanjuro!

331
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:04,657
Stay strong, Lord Momonosuke!

332
00:21:04,740 --> 00:21:05,740
This is terrible!

333
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:07,690
Damn.

334
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:10,077
So the whole plan nearly
fell apart because

335
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:12,537
Kanjuro's been feeding info to the enemy?

336
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:13,700
So it would seem.

337
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,660
We better save Momo quick.

338
00:21:17,440 --> 00:21:18,280
On it.

339
00:21:24,460 --> 00:21:25,597
Hey, Luffy!

340
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:28,720
It turns out Kanjuro is
actually an enemy spy!

341
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:32,180
He's taking Momo away right now! Huh?

342
00:21:32,620 --> 00:21:34,700
Are you sure? No way!

343
00:21:34,900 --> 00:21:37,606
Fooled us all this time
and nobody had a clue?

344
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:40,660
What a jerk!

345
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:46,680
We can't let that bastard get away!

346
00:21:46,900 --> 00:21:48,488
I'll try to shoot him down!

347
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:53,280
Special attack, Green Star Platinus!

348
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:54,720
Shoot him in!

349
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:06,040
a valiant effort but not enough i don't
have time to entertain imbeciles like you

350
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:24,020
what's that cloud i have a bad feeling
about this sir sanji turn back immediately

351
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:30,820
Whatever technique he's doing, I've
never seen it before! Ink? Close!

352
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:37,440
Ink arrows, fall like rain!

353
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:49,140
Wukio portrait, evening shower!

354
00:22:55,760 --> 00:22:57,300
It's dangerous here!

355
00:22:57,580 --> 00:22:59,286
Turn the boat around quickly!

356
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:04,420
I need help! Nami!

357
00:23:08,280 --> 00:23:10,497
Only one man's allowed to shoot an arrow

358
00:23:10,580 --> 00:23:12,777
through Nami and Robin's
heart figuratively,

359
00:23:12,860 --> 00:23:14,360
and that man is me!

360
00:23:15,860 --> 00:23:16,690
Sanji!

361
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:22,437
I am begging you to
please stop this, Kanjuro!

362
00:23:22,520 --> 00:23:25,320
You are going to kill
every last one of them!

363
00:23:26,140 --> 00:23:27,480
That I shall!

364
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,760
And rightfully so.

365
00:23:30,520 --> 00:23:32,160
It's their time.

366
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,940
Your father, Rodin,

367
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:37,497
and your mother, Toki,

368
00:23:37,580 --> 00:23:39,637
dangled a false hope
in front of those poor

369
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:42,191
fools by delaying their inevitable deaths.

370
00:23:42,820 --> 00:23:47,540
Now, 20 years later, their
execution must be completed at last.

371
00:23:49,820 --> 00:23:50,650
Frankly,

372
00:23:50,733 --> 00:23:53,537
it would be a mercy since
those foolish samurai are

373
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:56,757
now serving under a cowardly
little imp like yourself.

374
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:59,797
You are nothing but an
imprudent child lacking in

375
00:23:59,880 --> 00:24:03,056
conviction and whimpering
at the first sign of danger.

376
00:24:08,020 --> 00:24:10,680
You can cry, but I will laugh.

377
00:24:11,080 --> 00:24:12,480
What am I to say?

378
00:24:15,580 --> 00:24:19,317
I know best of all that
I'm no Kozuki Onion.

379
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:22,460
Or how can I ever help to measure up?

380
00:24:26,820 --> 00:24:29,460
What am I supposed to do? I'm helpless!

381
00:24:35,700 --> 00:24:38,288
Are you certain that's
what you want to say?

382
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:42,080
You tell them that no one
will come to your aid!

383
00:24:44,940 --> 00:24:45,770
But...

384
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:54,030
Everyone!

385
00:24:54,113 --> 00:24:56,940
Can you hear me?!

386
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:01,080
That's Lord Momonosuke!

387
00:25:01,820 --> 00:25:05,700
I ask you that you do not
worry about my well-being!

388
00:25:07,460 --> 00:25:11,060
That is exactly what the
enemy wants you to do!

389
00:25:12,680 --> 00:25:16,357
I promise to you, I shall
escape all on my own!

390
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:19,700
You must have been Kaido
and Orochi without me!

391
00:25:20,020 --> 00:25:22,860
Please find a way to
protect the land of Boiro!

392
00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:31,060
Such noble words from the young lord.

393
00:25:31,380 --> 00:25:33,520
It stirs my heart to hear them.

394
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:35,760
How brave you've turned out to be!

395
00:25:37,620 --> 00:25:39,920
We all put our faith in you!

396
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:42,080
That was pretty manly.

397
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:43,760
Nice job, Momo.

398
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:47,980
Hey, Momo!

399
00:25:49,500 --> 00:25:51,240
It's okay, I know!

400
00:25:51,820 --> 00:25:54,761
You're just a little crybaby
with a dumb top knot!

401
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:56,786
What are you gonna do anyway?

402
00:25:57,180 --> 00:25:58,886
Nothing, and you know it too!

403
00:25:59,100 --> 00:26:00,982
How could you be so rude to him?

404
00:26:01,100 --> 00:26:02,317
You better take that back!

405
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:03,694
Who's this guy anyway?

406
00:26:03,820 --> 00:26:04,880
I'll chop him up!

407
00:26:05,220 --> 00:26:07,320
Gotta find a way to survive, okay?

408
00:26:07,780 --> 00:26:10,900
Just hang on, and we'll
come rescue you! No!

409
00:26:15,460 --> 00:26:16,931
Because you're my friend!

410
00:26:40,700 --> 00:26:41,530
Okay.

411
00:26:44,300 --> 00:26:47,240
Off to Onigashima! Yeah!

412
00:27:04,280 --> 00:27:05,160
Luffy!

413
00:27:05,900 --> 00:27:08,312
One of the enemy's ships is getting away!

414
00:27:10,040 --> 00:27:14,981
Let it go, they're all heading in the same
direction anyway, we can sink them later.

415
00:27:17,360 --> 00:27:19,220
Hey, wasn't there another ship?

416
00:27:19,340 --> 00:27:21,400
There was, but then I sunk it.

417
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:27,057
Master King, forgive me.

418
00:27:27,140 --> 00:27:29,000
I failed to protect him.

419
00:27:29,200 --> 00:27:31,200
You are alive, then that's enough.

420
00:27:31,380 --> 00:27:34,733
I doubt they will take Ward
Momonosuke's life right away.

421
00:27:35,820 --> 00:27:40,500
One question though, your
face, how did it transform so?

422
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:45,320
A tale for another time.

423
00:27:47,600 --> 00:27:49,540
It is good to see you.

424
00:27:50,320 --> 00:27:51,860
Is everyone all right?

425
00:27:52,060 --> 00:27:53,000
Who needs help?

426
00:27:53,300 --> 00:27:57,160
We have a few injuries and
some ships in need of repair.

427
00:27:57,680 --> 00:28:00,357
I appreciate it, but I
just entered the island.

428
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:03,080
I didn't come this far just to die at sea.

429
00:28:04,860 --> 00:28:08,780
Hey, my ship is not your
personal samurai garrison!

430
00:28:12,660 --> 00:28:13,760
We'll behave.

431
00:28:14,620 --> 00:28:16,660
I said you're not welcome here!

432
00:28:16,860 --> 00:28:17,700
Pack it up!

433
00:28:19,220 --> 00:28:23,460
Men, make sure the Straw Hats
don't hog all the glory! Yeah!

434
00:28:30,260 --> 00:28:31,520
What was that?

435
00:28:31,700 --> 00:28:32,641
Oh, he's firing!

436
00:28:34,780 --> 00:28:36,620
It's the ship that got away!

437
00:28:38,340 --> 00:28:39,680
On-range cannon?

438
00:28:39,980 --> 00:28:42,837
They can still hit us from
all the way over there!

439
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:46,391
So they weren't running away,
they were just repositioning!

440
00:28:50,600 --> 00:28:55,237
these are our high precision
cannons the best in wano we got

441
00:28:55,320 --> 00:28:59,217
weapons factories all over the
country pumping these bad boys out and

442
00:28:59,300 --> 00:29:02,617
if these don't do the job we
have plenty of other ways to blow

443
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:07,800
you up why don't you come at us
show us what you got are you scared

444
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:14,780
Hold the ship back!

445
00:29:15,020 --> 00:29:17,020
Those shots can save us from here!

446
00:29:27,660 --> 00:29:28,500
Damn it.

447
00:29:28,760 --> 00:29:31,936
I thought it was weird that
they fled without a fight.

448
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:34,840
Full speed ahead!

449
00:29:35,160 --> 00:29:36,580
We gotta get closer!

450
00:29:39,780 --> 00:29:44,160
I don't care how many samurai ships
sink as long as we make it there.

451
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:52,160
Damn it.

452
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:54,636
We can't let them keep this distance.

453
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,740
We'll sink.

454
00:29:56,980 --> 00:29:58,340
We must close the gap.

455
00:30:04,740 --> 00:30:06,877
Seems this battle's already over.

456
00:30:06,960 --> 00:30:09,440
We're untouchable from back here!

457
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:22,320
Now fire! Fire!

458
00:30:27,220 --> 00:30:29,380
Fishman Caracal!

459
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:31,780
Spill it away!

460
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,160
Oh, crap!

461
00:30:52,420 --> 00:30:54,057
There's a huge hole in the ship!

462
00:30:54,140 --> 00:30:54,970
It's falling!

463
00:31:01,620 --> 00:31:02,780
Fishback karate!

464
00:31:04,100 --> 00:31:06,380
Spear wave for a summer!

465
00:31:19,220 --> 00:31:21,749
That guy just destroyed
all of our cannons!

466
00:31:25,140 --> 00:31:27,097
Something is happening over there.

467
00:31:27,180 --> 00:31:29,517
What if a child drowned
at sea and came back

468
00:31:29,600 --> 00:31:32,037
as a vengeful ghost intent
on killing them all?

469
00:31:32,120 --> 00:31:32,950
No!

470
00:31:33,360 --> 00:31:35,317
You got the vengeful part right.

471
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:37,120
Wait, but what was that?

472
00:31:46,060 --> 00:31:48,240
I think somebody's down there.

473
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:54,720
Everyone, if I may have a word.

474
00:31:57,380 --> 00:32:02,137
I hail from the Fishman
District of the Ryugu Kingdom.

475
00:32:02,220 --> 00:32:06,660
A place beneath the waves for
those bold enough to seek passage.

476
00:32:09,840 --> 00:32:13,140
My apologies for the trouble
I may have caused you,

477
00:32:13,460 --> 00:32:15,872
especially seeing that I'm a new recruit.

478
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:19,237
But I have ventured here
today to share a ceremonial

479
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:22,580
cup of sake with the boss of
the Straw Hat Pirate Crew.

480
00:32:23,220 --> 00:32:24,940
If you'll have me, that is.

481
00:32:30,320 --> 00:32:31,880
I'm known as

482
00:32:32,600 --> 00:32:35,180
First son of the sea, Jinbe

483
00:32:38,700 --> 00:32:40,020
Are you kidding?

484
00:32:40,460 --> 00:32:43,520
He is seriously going
to join the Straw Huts

485
00:32:44,740 --> 00:32:50,800
It hasn't been long So I'm certain you'll
remember me Now let's make this official,

486
00:32:50,980 --> 00:32:51,810
shall we?

487
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:03,796
Jinbe!

488
00:33:03,879 --> 00:33:04,709
It's Jinbe!

489
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:10,306
So sorry to keep you waiting,
but I thank you for indulging me.

490
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:14,520
Luffy, I have come back
alive just as I promised.

491
00:33:15,040 --> 00:33:17,880
Glad I made it back in
time for the big battle!

492
00:33:24,940 --> 00:33:26,380
We'll be back.
